0..66 Comment "// A flow between data types given by a translator, after directed"
67..140 Comment "// univalence (Gratzer, Weinberger and Buchholtz, _Directed univalence in"
141..219 Comment "// simplicial homotopy type theory_, arXiv:2407.09146, Definition 1.2): a data"
220..294 Comment "// type is covered as the sum of its constructors, each the product of its"
295..371 Comment "// fields, so a translator that only moves fields between constructors gives"
372..438 Comment "// a flow, and riding it moves a value of the old type to the new."
